        see:a member grown loud un-crushes its family across passes — importance re-opens what the floor closed and the meek siblings ride along
        see:a scope re-cut its innards inside its standing polygon — the outside held still while the heavier weight grew its share of the same room
        see:a dissenting family demotes the shared truth — format falls from fact to spread at the top and in the pool alike when the annex arrives carrying mp3
        see:the door recounts to twenty when the annex joins — the dip count follows the truth it hides
        see:two families with one joint difference wear identical crests — the crest is marginal by design and only the counted door tells them apart
        see:the twin doors open to the same counts and different rooms — four members each with the joints differing exactly where the crest stayed silent
        see:surf into the scope and its cell becomes the viewport — the shoal un-crushes at 13093 with the whole room behind it
